                                                "sense_id": "8ef684f1-7483-3c00-bac7-e7262ee2eeb5",
                                                "text": "It may get even busier in town when a sleek train service called the Brightline debuts this summer, shuttling travelers between nearby West Palm Beach and Miami."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ebd41f7-b127-44f8-a285-2b55bd4b6928",
                                                "sense_id": "8ef684f1-7483-3c00-bac7-e7262ee2eeb5",
                                                "text": "Fort Lauderdale–Hollywood International and Palm Beach International are solid choices if your final destination is north of Miami city limits."
